      "title": "NovaRetail Achieves Steady Growth Amid Regional Operational Risks",
      "summary": "NovaRetail achieved total revenue of 1280.0 million USD in 2026-Q2, representing 4.49 percent QoQ growth. While APAC led expansion with 26.92 percent revenue growth since 2025-Q3, Latin America experienced a 6.67 percent revenue decline. Operational risks present the biggest threat, as Latin America delivery times rose by 2.0 days and fraud incidents increased by 12.",
